Each example is a complete Oriel app under [`examples/`](https://github.com/highercomve/Oriel/tree/main/examples), with its own `build.zig`. Build one from its directory with `zig build` (or `oriel run`); add `-Dnative_ui` for the [native renderer]($link.page('docs/native-renderer')).

| Example | What it shows |
|---|---|
| [showcase](#showcase) | Every module in one app, on Linux, Windows, macOS, Android and iOS |
| [smoke](#smoke) | A pass/fail check of every module, run in CI |
| [breakout](#breakout) | A canvas game in both renderers, its loop in JavaScript or in Zig |
| [system-monitor](#system-monitor) | Live CPU, memory and processes read from `/proc` in Zig |
| [render-bench](#render-bench) | One page timed in the WebView and the native renderer |
| [canvas-demo](#canvas-demo) | The 2d canvas: shapes, text, animation and calls that must not break the window |

# [showcase]($heading.id('showcase'))

[`examples/showcase`](https://github.com/highercomve/Oriel/tree/main/examples/showcase): everything Oriel does, in one app built from the same `src/main.zig` and `web/` for every platform. Each tab covers one area:

- **Dictate**: voice to text with `oriel.dictation` (whisper on the CPU or the GPU, or the system recognizer), live text, file transcription and "dictate anywhere".
- **Chat**: a local LLM with `oriel.chat` (llama.cpp): streamed replies, Stop, KV-cache reuse, a GPU against CPU comparison, and Read aloud.
- **Speak**: offline text to speech with `oriel.tts` (Kokoro 82M): voices by language, speed, and per utterance the first-audio time, real-time factor and gaps.
- **Notes**: SQLite (`oriel.sql`) and deep links (`oriel-showcase://note/<text>`).
- **Files**: open and save dialogs, transcribing a WAV file.
- **System**: clipboard, notifications, shortcuts; the tray, menus and typing into other apps on desktops; the Quick Settings tile and the keyboard on Android.
- **App**: windows, IPC, events from a worker thread, device info.

Models are not in the app: Dictate, Chat and Speak download them on first use.

```sh
cd examples/showcase
zig build run                          # Linux, macOS
oriel package                          # deb, rpm, AppImage / .app, .dmg / NSIS installer
oriel android dev --abi arm64          # on a connected phone
```

